OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 30 JAN
OL,4,G1200FJeremy Vine
OL,5,     GJeremy talks about the radio
OL,6,     Ggenius of Sir Terry Wogan with
OL,7,     Ghis son Mark, ten years after our
OL,8,     Gdear friend and Radio 2 colleague
OL,9,     Gdied.
OL,10,G1400FDJ Spoony
OL,11,     GDJ Spoony sits in, bringing you
OL,12,     Gsome of the best music from
OL,13,     Gacross the decades to get you
OL,14,     Gthrough the afternoon.
OL,15,G1600FSara Cox
OL,16,     GIt's All Request Friday, and Sara
OL,17,     Gwants to hear from you on 88291
OL,18,     Gor sara.cox@bbc.co.uk.
OL,19,G1900FMichelle Visage
OL,20,     GGet into the groove and dance
OL,21,     Gyourself dizzy at Michelle's
OL,22,     GFabulous Friday party.
